            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Progesterone releasing I.U.D. improves dysmenorrhea and hypermenorrhea. This type of I.U.D. may be used whereas other I.U.D. are contra indicated. But over all it is a new kind of drug delivery system which could be used with other medications, for other purposes than contraception.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
